   :appearance "A thick-set man of sixty-two, stooped at the shoulders, grey-moustached and steel-spectacled, in a dark waistcoat under a brown shop apron. He stands with his feet planted apart."
   :manner "You meet a stranger squarely, hands still, and answer their first question with a weight or a price before offering much beyond a nod."
